{"ID":"20240206115424-p3yg3fl","Spec":"1","Type":"NodeDocument","Properties":{"id":"20240206115424-p3yg3fl","scroll":"\u0026#123;\u0026quot;rootId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240206115424-p3yg3fl\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;startId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240206115433-wlu9zl5\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;endId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240206115427-8ybvp5j\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;scrollTop\u0026quot;:0,\u0026quot;focusId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240206115433-wlu9zl5\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;focusStart\u0026quot;:145,\u0026quot;focusEnd\u0026quot;:145\u0026#125;","title":"银杏叶（白果叶）","type":"doc","updated":"20240902175948"},"Children":[{"ID":"20240206115433-wlu9zl5","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240206115433-wlu9zl5","updated":"20240206115435"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【产地】\t主产于四川、江苏、湖北、广西等地。\n【性状】\t本品多皱折或破碎，完整者呈扇形，长312cm，宽515cm。黄绿色或浅棕黄色，上缘呈不规则的波状弯曲，有的中间凹入，深者可达叶长的4/5。具二叉状平行叶脉，细而密，光滑无毛，易纵向撕裂。叶基楔形叶柄长2"},{"Type":"NodeBackslash","Data":"span","Children":[{"Type":"NodeBackslashContent","Data":"~"}]},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"8cm。体轻。气微，味微苦。\n【性味】\t甘、苦、涩，平。\n【功效】\t敛肺，平喘，活血化瘀，止痛。用于肺虚咳喘；冠心病，心绞痛，高血脂，抗凝固，有一定概率提高记忆力。"}]},{"ID":"20240206115427-8ybvp5j","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240206115427-8ybvp5j","updated":"20240206115427"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"image"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/image-20240206115427-vykobhb.png"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240221195631-79uw4aq","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240221195631-79uw4aq","updated":"20240729085746"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​​"}]},{"ID":"20240729085735-npf3b7m","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240729085735-npf3b7m","updated":"20240729085747"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 458px;","style":"width: 448px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"白果 (1)"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/白果 1-20240717160632-udtg1pg.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 448px;\" parent-style=\"width: 458px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 417px;","style":"width: 407px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"白果 (4)"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/白果 4-20240717161115-rpefea8.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 407px;\" parent-style=\"width: 417px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 360px;","style":"width: 350px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"image"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/image-20240221195631-u2ughze.png"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 350px;\" parent-style=\"width: 360px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240729085735-ajhk9ka","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240729085735-ajhk9ka","updated":"20240729085735"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 307px;","style":"width: 297px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"白果 (3)"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/白果 3-20240717161046-gvzsoqz.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 2